ging URLs\n\n6\n2f68c58715ce\ncomplete\nRedirect URIs registered for all UAT URLs\n\n### Critical: channel\\_id Parameter Enforcement\n\n7\ne9594ae62937\nincomplete\n~~channel\\_id parameter is included in all guest access token requests (client\\_credentials grant)~~\n\n8\na7ccd0763e6d\nincomplete\n~~channel\\_id parameter is included in all PKCE auth flows (authorization\\_code\\_pkce grant)~~\n\n9\n40bb9b467b70\nincomplete\nGuest browsing tested end-to-end on all seven storefronts without 400 errors\n\n10\nedeb3d3a3096\nincomplete\nSLAS error logs checked in Log Centre for any 400/authentication failures\n\n### ~~Hybrid Auth (v25.3+)~~\n\n11\n55ae499e3390\nincomplete\n~~Confirm whether implementation used Plugin SLAS or native Hybrid Auth~~\n\n12\naef39f41026d\nincomplete\n~~If Plugin SLAS was used, confirm migration to Hybrid Auth is complete~~\n\n13\n5d5f0f2a1074\nincomplete\n~~Hybrid Auth tested on all storefront guest and registered flows~~\n\n### Authentication Flows — End-to-End Testing\n\n14\n11ae93348f39\nincomplete\nGuest checkout flow working (guest token, basket creation, order submission)\n\n15\ndec01634e810\nincomplete\nRegistered login via email/password working (PKCE flow)\n\n16\nf1003710d177\nincomplete\nPasswordless OTP login working — email template configured in BM\n\n17\nf3d7281eca67\nincomplete\nSocial login (Google) working — redirect URIs registered with Google OAuth app\n\n18\n90f2f0596089\nincomplete\nSocial login (Apple) working — redirect URIs registered with Apple\n\n19\n18f11cd40ff9\nincomplete\nRegistered login → basket merge working (guest basket merges into registered basket on login)\n\n20\nb6e465ddf6d6\nincomplete\n\"Remember me\" / persistent session working correctly\n\n### SLAS Token Scopes\n\n21\n43f09825e0d1\ncomplete\nSLAS client scopes reviewed — only required scopes granted (principle of least privilege)\n\n22\n52e9282237f5\ncomplete\nNo SLAS client has excessive scopes (e.g. admin scopes on a public client)\n\n---\n\nNot