      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Panel behaviour"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given a logged-out shopper triggers the wishlist action, when the wishlist icon is clicked, then the panel slides in from the right using the pdp/drawer shell ("
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineCard",
                  "attrs": {
                    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-736#icft=SFCC-736"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ")."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given the panel is open, when the close icon is clicked, then the panel dismisses and focus returns to the wishlist icon that triggered it."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Content"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given the panel renders, then it displays a heading and explanatory copy informing the shopper they must log in or create an account to save items."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given the panel renders, then an email input field and a \"Send Code\" button are visible for magic link / OTP login."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5. Given the panel renders, then \"Sign in with Apple\" and \"Sign in with Google\" buttons are visible."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6. Given the panel renders, then a \"New to Zimmermann?\" section is visible with supporting copy and a \"Create an Account\" CTA."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Responsive"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "7. Given the component is rendered at size=Large, size=Small, or size=Mobile, when it mounts, then the layout matches the corresponding Figma design spec variant."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Empty & error states"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "8. Given the panel content fails to load, then no broken layout is shown and the drawer shell remains dismissible."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Accessibility"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "9. Given the panel opens, then focus moves into the panel and is trapped within it until closed."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "10. Given the panel closes, then focus returns to the wishlist icon that triggered it."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "11. The panel has role=dialog and an appropriate aria-label."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "12. The component meets WCAG 2.1 AA."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
